  "details": "For streamers and videographers, I think it would be a great opportunity to implement a microphone with similar placement capabilities as the in-game camera; local, in-world, connected to the camera or how it already functions, based off of where the camera owner is. That simply itself would be an amazing addition to VRChat, especially for small creators and for events such as the VRChat Film Jam. You could even add other microphone functions such as gain (how far the microphone picks up) and what it picks up, like the different sound controls (voice, world volume, avatar sounds, etc.)",
